                                "sense_id": "0cc2c2ba-be1a-3f6d-9685-071c1c86d10d",
                                "text": "Thus, with the passing years, Papa Wemba, a hardworking and introverted man, has come to embody “African pop,” forming a triptych with Youssou N’Dour and Salif Keita.",
                                "translation": "因此，随着岁月的流逝，勤劳内向的帕帕·温巴逐渐成为“非洲流行音乐”的化身，与尤苏·恩多尔和萨利夫·凯塔组成了三人组合。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f26f13c6-0182-4634-83f5-46e14bcad162",
                                "sense_id": "0cc2c2ba-be1a-3f6d-9685-071c1c86d10d",
                                "text": "Woodson, the recipient of four Newbery Honor awards, has written her first adult novel in 20 years, returning to the Brooklyn setting of “Autobiography of a Family Photo” (1995) and her recent award-winning memoir, “Brown Girl Dreaming.” These works form a triptych of bildungsromans taking place in the author’s hometown and tracking her generation’s coming to adulthood.",
                                "translation": "伍德森曾四次荣获纽伯瑞儿童文学奖，这是她二十年来创作的第一部成人小说，故事背景设定在布鲁克林，与她1995年的作品《家庭照片自传》以及近期获奖回忆录《棕色女孩之梦》遥相呼应。这三部作品构成了一部成长小说三部曲，故事均发生在作者的家乡，讲述了她这一代人走向成年的历程。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c6047a8e-d033-4df8-9022-e0fcfeb44af1",
                                "sense_id": "0cc2c2ba-be1a-3f6d-9685-071c1c86d10d",
                                "text": "The show was the first in a triptych of excellent Australian dramas produced by John Edwards that tapped into the sensibility of a generation. It was followed by the thirtysomething drama, Love My Way, and Tangle, which focused on fortysomethings.",
                                "translation": "这部剧是约翰·爱德华兹制作的三部优秀澳大利亚剧集中的第一部，精准地捕捉到了一代人的情感。之后，他又制作了以三十多岁人群为主角的《爱我的方式》和以四十多岁人群为主角的《纠缠》。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fc1970a-a4c8-4b56-add1-119a1f626365",
                                "sense_id": "0cc2c2ba-be1a-3f6d-9685-071c1c86d10d",
                                "text": "The centerpiece of the show is a poised, luminous, tender, and diabolically clever video installation, “Le Triptyque de Noirmoutier” (The Noirmoutier Triptych), which Varda shot on 35-mm. film[…]。The man gets himself a bottle of beer; the older woman heads with dishes from the sink toward the cupboard—and crosses the dividing line of the triptych exactly like crossing a threshold."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
